# Enquiry form delivery.
# Left empty: "Send enquiry" opens the visitor's email app with the enquiry
# filled in and addressed to info@intellizen.co.in (manual send, no service needed).
# To send automatically later, set both lines, e.g. for Web3Forms:
#   VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
#   VITE_FORM_ACCESS_KEY=<your Web3Forms access key>
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
VITE_FORM_ACCESS_KEY=
